{"step_index":253,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T02:02:57Z","thinking":"The HTML report is complete. The next critical task involves updating the specified Excel file. The constraints regarding OneDrive access and interference with existing Excel processes are carefully reviewed to ensure compliance during the update procedure.\n\n\nA backup of the Excel file is necessary to prevent data loss before proceeding with updates. The script will then populate specified columns in the '기업 정보' sheet for rows 19201 to 19400 with data from a source, ensuring number types are handled correctly. Hyperlinks are also to be generated where applicable.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst ExcelJS = require('exceljs');\n\nasync function main() {\n  const masterFile = 'C:/Users/lg/resilient-bardeen/data/(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.xlsx';\n  const backupFile = 'C:/Users/lg/resilient-bardeen/data/(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명_backup_19201_19400.xlsx';\n  \n  console.log('1. Creating safety backup...');\n  if (!fs.existsSync(backupFile)) {\n    fs.copyFileSync(masterFile, backupFile);\n    console.log('Backup created successfully at:', backupFile);\n  } else {\n    console.log('Backup already exists at:', backupFile);\n  }\n\n  console.log('2. Loading finalized 200 records JSON...');\n  const list = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/verify_and_update_db/verified_200_final.json', 'utf-8'));\n  console.log('Loaded', list.length, 'records.');\n\n  console.log('3. Loading master Excel workbook...');\n  const workbook = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n  await workbook.xlsx.readFile(masterFile);\n  const sheet = workbook.getWorksheet('기업 정보');\n  console.log('Worksheet loaded. Total rows:', sheet.rowCount);\n\n  const orangeFill = {\n    type: 'pattern',\n    pattern: 'solid',\n    fgColor: { argb: 'FFFFA500' } // Standard Orange\n  };\n\n  let totalUpdatedCells = 0;\n\n  console.log('4. Applying updates to rows 19201 through 19400...');\n  for (let i = 0; i < list.length; i++) {\n    const r = list[i];\n    const rowNum = 19201 + i;\n    const row = sheet.getRow(rowNum);\n\n    const biznoClean = r.bizno ? String(r.bizno).replace(/[^0-9]/g, '') : '';\n    const biznoUrl = biznoClean ? 'https://bizno.net/article/' + biznoClean : '';\n\n    const newValues = {\n      1: r.author || '배현명',\n      2: r.status || null,\n      3: r.company || null,\n      4: biznoClean ? (biznoUrl ? { text: biznoClean, hyperlink: biznoUrl } : (isNaN(biznoClean) ? biznoClean : Number(biznoClean))) : null,\n      5: r.ceo || null,\n      6: r.zip ? (isNaN(r.zip) ? r.zip : Number(r.zip)) : null,\n      7: r.addr || null,\n      8: r.tel || null,\n      9: r.fax || null,\n      10: r.homepage || null,\n      11: r.email || null,\n      15: r.employees ? (isNaN(r.employees) ? r.employees : Number(r.employees)) : null,\n      18: r.industry || null,\n      24: biznoClean ? (isNaN(biznoClean) ? biznoClean : Number(biznoClean)) : null,\n      25: r.corpNo || null,\n      31: r.closingMonth || null,\n      48: r.catLarge || null,\n      49: r.catMid || null,\n      50: r.catSmall || null\n    };\n\n    for (const [colStr, newVal] of Object.entries(newValues)) {\n      const col = Number(colStr);\n      const cell = row.getCell(col);\n      const origVal = cell.value;\n\n      const normOrig = origVal === null || origVal === undefined ? '' : String(typeof origVal === 'object' && origVal.text ? origVal.text : origVal).trim();\n      const normNew = newVal === null || newVal === undefined ? '' : String(typeof newVal === 'object' && newVal.text ? newVal.text : newVal).trim();\n\n      cell.value = newVal;\n\n      // Orange highlight on any populated or modified cell\n      if (normNew !== '') {\n        cell.fill = orangeFill;\n        totalUpdatedCells++;\n      }\n    }\n\n    row.commit();\n  }\n\n  console.log(`Successfully updated rows 19201~19400. Total styled/populated cells: ${totalUpdatedCells}`);\n\n  console.log('5. Saving workbook to temporary file...');\n  const tempFile = masterFile + '.tmp';\n  await workbook.xlsx.writeFile(tempFile);\n  console.log('Saved to temp file. File size:', fs.statSync(tempFile).size);\n\n  console.log('6. Safely replacing master Excel file...');\n  if (fs.existsSync(masterFile)) {\n    fs.unlinkSync(masterFile);\n  }\n  fs.renameSync(tempFile, masterFile);\n  console.log('Master Excel updated successfully! File size:', fs.statSync(masterFile).size);\n\n  // Also copy to Today directory if exists\n  const todayDir = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/Today';\n  if (fs.existsSync(todayDir)) {\n    const todayMaster = todayDir + '/(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.xlsx';\n    fs.copyFileSync(masterFile, todayMaster);\n    console.log('Copied updated master Excel to Desktop/Today:', todayMaster);\n\n    const todayTsv = todayDir + '/배현명_실사DB_200개기업_18컬럼_최종검증완료.tsv';\n    const todayCsv = todayDir + '/배현명_실사DB_200개기업_18컬럼_최종검증완료.csv';\n    const todayHtml = todayDir + '/배현명_실사DB_200개기업_검증결과리포트.html';\n    fs.copyFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/verify_and_update_db/배현명_실사DB_200개기업_18컬럼_최종검증완료.tsv', todayTsv);\n    fs.copyFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/verify_and_update_db/배현명_실사DB_200개기업_18컬럼_최종검증완료.csv', todayCsv);\n    fs.copyFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/verify_and_update_db/배현명_실사DB_200개기업_검증결과리포트.html', todayHtml);\n    console.log('Copied TSV, CSV, and HTML reports to Desktop/Today!');\n  }\n}\n\nmain().catch(console.error);\n","Description":"Script to apply updates to master Excel and style orange","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\verify_and_update_db\\apply_updates_to_master_excel.js","toolAction":"Creating master Excel update script","toolSummary":"Write apply_updates_to_master_excel.js"}}]}
